        <https://legal.dz/resource/law/2016-03-06/16-01#art_107>,
        <https://legal.dz/resource/law/2016-03-06/16-01#art_109>,
        <https://legal.dz/resource/law/2016-03-06/16-01#art_111>,
        <https://legal.dz/resource/law/2016-03-06/16-01#art_142>,
        <https://legal.dz/resource/law/2016-03-06/16-01#art_144>,
